# {{projectName}}

Built with Svelte 5 + Feature-Sliced Design architecture.

## Stack
- **Framework:** Svelte 5 (runes)
- **Build:** Vite
- **Architecture:** Feature-Sliced Design (FSD)
- **Language:** TypeScript
{{#if useTailwind}}
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
{{/if}}

## Project Structure (FSD)
```
src/
  app/          # App shell, global styles, router
  pages/        # Page compositions
  widgets/      # Composite features (combines features + entities)
    {{moduleName}}/
      {{moduleName}}Widget.svelte
  features/     # User interactions, state (one per business feature)
    {{moduleName}}/
      api/      # API calls, types
      ui/       # UI components for this feature
      index.ts
  entities/     # Business entities (shared across features)
  shared/       # Shared libs: API client, config, UI kit
    api/
    config/
    lib/
    ui/
```

## Commands
```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server
npm run build    # Production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run unit tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```
